  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Proteccin y Sustentabilidad Social</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Protection and Sustainability Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the program will be to contribute to avoid that the effects of the actual economic crisis fall on the poor sectors of the population. It includes three areas of action: (i) Monitoring of the agreements with the IMF; (ii) Budgetary protection of the PSP; and (iii) sustainability of the advances of modernization in education, health, and social security.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
